# Intermediário

## Personalização de tema

### Temas predefinidos



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
df13 <- dados %>% 
  filter(country == "United States")
df13$year <- as.factor(df13$year)

ggplot(df13, aes(x = gdpPercap, y = pop, color = year)) +
  geom_point(size = 3)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-19-1.png){width=672}
:::
