### Título e subtítulo

#### Título



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(df13, aes(x = gdpPercap, y = pop, color = year)) +
  geom_point(size = 3) +
  ggtitle("PIB per capita e população nos Estados Unidos") +
  theme(plot.title = element_text(hjust = 0.5, size = 12, face = "bold", color = "darkgreen"))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-24-1.png){width=672}
:::

```{.r .cell-code}
# OU
ggplot(df13, aes(x = gdpPercap, y = pop, color = year)) +
  geom_point(size = 3) +
  labs(title = "PIB per capita e população nos Estados Unidos") +
  theme(plot.title = element_text(hjust = 0.5, size = 14, face = "bold", color = "darkgreen"))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-24-2.png){width=672}
:::
:::



